{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103926","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103926/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103926/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103926/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103926","id":2908203135,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OCzS2","number":103926,"title":"AudioStreamPlayer3D: Improve spatialization in stereo","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-03-10T19:18:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T23:09:01Z","closed_at":"2025-03-28T22:32:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103926","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103926.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103926.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Fixes #103989.\r\n\r\nI think that using the tightness parameter of the SPCAP model as the panning strength was a mistake. Panning strength is an effect that should be applied at the end of the processing to change the final mix. I've done that and I've exposed the tightness parameter in the inspector for more flexibility.\r\n\r\nAlso, the SPCAP model seems to be developed for 5.1 setups and up. But the [paper](https://apps.dtic.mil/sti/tr/pdf/ADA464895.pdf) says that the resulting output is good to be downmixed for setups with less speakers. I've used the 5.1 speaker setup internally, and downmixed for the stereo and 3.1 setups.\r\n\r\nWith these changes, the audio positioning should be better in stereo and 3.1 setups, also the headphone output, and the panning strength should work more as intended. Tested only with stereo speakers and headphones. Needs more testing with more setups.\r\n\r\nWith panning strength at 1.0, no speaker will be muted, but I think it wouldn't make sense to forcibly mute any speakers for this case. We achieve maximum stereo separation though, as output by SPCAP. For further separation of channels, tightness can be increased.\r\n\r\nThis PR will work better together with #103856.","closed_by":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103926/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103926/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}